GIMP Palette
Name: Tokyo Night Light
#
# Tokyo Night Light for Xournal++ (light-paper companion to Tokyo Night)
# Source: enkia/tokyo-night-vscode-theme README "Tokyo Night Light" table
#   editor.background #e6e7ed, editor.foreground #343b58
# Use on light paper (#e6e7ed via Journal -> Configure Page Template).
# For dark paper (#1a1b26) use the Tokyo Night palette instead.
# Background first / Foreground last mirrors the Dracula Xournal++ port.
# Install: file lives in ~/.config/xournalpp/palettes/, then
#   Edit -> Preferences -> Palette -> Tokyo Night Light (restart if missing).
